{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017TpdDyoc6yDywAWfGv3BFv","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"element fire:\n{\n  \"look\": {\n    \"color\": [\n      0.95,\n      0.42,\n      0.12\n    ]\n  }\n}\nReferred to by (38):\ncombos.elements[0]\ncritters[ember-newt].element\nentities.bone-hound.raider.weak[0]\nentities.ash-crab.raider.resist[0]\nlooks.bare.shows.elements[0]\nlooks.bare.turnsOnly[0]\nreactions.cell[fire-fog].element\nreactions.cell[fire-mud].element\nreactions.cell[fire-oil].element\nreactions.cell[fire-thorns].element\nreactions.cell[fire-melt].element\nreactions.cell[fire-thaw].element\nreactions.cell[fire-ice].element\nreactions.cell[fire-water].element\nreactions.cell[fire-flammable].element\nreactions.cell[fire-heat].element\nreactions.entity[e-fire-wet].element\nreactions.entity[e-fire-frozen].element\nreactions.entity[e-fire-flammable].element\nreactions.entity[e-fire-creature].element\nreactions.entity[e-fire-thing].element\nspells[fire-bolt].group\nspells[fire-bolt].element\nspells[burning-hands].group\nspells[burning-hands].element\nspells[fireball].group\nspells[fireball].element\nspells[meteor].group\nspells[meteor].element\nspells[molten-boulder].element\nspells[scalding-steam].group\nspells[lava-pool].group\nspells[falling-star].group\nspells[falling-star].element\nspells[flame-wave].group\nspells[flame-wave].element\nspells[whirlwind].carries[fire].id\nspells[whirlwind].carries[fire].sheds\nLook: an element's: only a colour, the colour of what fire makes in the world, whichever spell or reaction made it. set_look changes color. It also takes mix (several colours with weights, each cell picking one; with blend true, one colour mixed from them like paint) in place of color, and a where (a place, a cell, or around me, within so many cells) to colour only there. With by (me, a player's slot, or each with a mix), a color or mix colours only what that player casts, and wins over a spell's own colour and any where.\nNo mods are on: this is the base rules."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null}
